urse  that plays a part in it right place  right time uh junior positions at aaa  studios is so hard to come by so i got  very lucky that around the time where i  had actually just finished uh doing a  little bit of writing on  a title that is a known ip that i have  not announced  was  just before um  santa monica studio were looking for a  junior writer which is exactly the kind  of position that i am qualified to fill  you know studied at university writer  for 10 years but they're like if you  don't have triple a experience you can't  work in triple a unless you're a junior  um the fact that i had  already been working on you know short  stories and screenplays and all that  stuff which is what i submitted but i do  maintain lucky or not i don't think i  ever would have given up and that is it  for me today everybody thank you all  again um and i do want to be clear this  is a one-off generally i don't answer  any questions about santa monica studio  um it just felt fitting to do one right  now to cover these in the way that i can  but i don't want anyone to think this is  any kind of trend and uh yeah there'll  be two q and a's every month from now on  this one will be the gaming one for this  month even though i do i guess talk  about a lot of personal stuff the next  one will be the personal one where we  talk about anything else movies tv books  whatever the heck else you want moving  travel whatever because i just thought  yeah we'd split them into two so that'll  be in a couple of weeks you can ask  questions for either of them below i  will source them either way and thank  you for watching i will see you guys  next time bye
 

